ned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Rentheria/rentheria/commit/55f00d449cef447f8a72c0dbf001a257c0994871","node_id":"C_kwDOPuHxutoAKDU1ZjAwZDQ0OWNlZjQ0N2Y4YTcyYzBkYmYwMDFhMjU3YzA5OTQ4NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rentheria/rentheria/commit/d569f9df2098db7ee8382819ed6fd8a4e9005d66","sha":"d569f9df2098db7ee8382819ed6fd8a4e9005d66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rentheria/rentheria/commits/d569f9df2098db7ee8382819ed6fd8a4e9005d66"}],"sha":"55f00d449cef447f8a72c0dbf001a257c0994871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rentheria/rentheria/commits/55f00d449cef447f8a72c0dbf001a257c0994871"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rentheria/rentheria/commits/d569f9df2098db7ee8382819ed6fd8a4e9005d66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T19:09:54Z","email":"muhernandez@grupomavi.mx","name":"Manuel A. Hernandez Renteria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T19:09:54Z","email":"muhernandez@grupomavi.mx","name":"Manuel A. Hernandez Renteria"},"message":"feat: rebrand profile README around new visual identity\n\nReplace the old stats-widget README with a restrained, premium layout\naligned to BRAND.md: faceted T-Rex header (assets/calm-logo.png), wine\n(#501313) shield badges with a single brass (#C8962E) Cursor Ambassador\naccent, and copy that leads with the human, not a stack list.\n\n- Drop github-readme-stats, streak-stats, emoji soup, and the \"5+ years\"\n  claim; state \"senior\" with no year count.\n- Replace Swiss Premier with current work: Abe''s Pottery API\n  (NestJS 11 / Prisma 7 / Postgres 15) and APCL / IMT Pave (Flutter,\n  offline PCI scoring + maintenance modeling).\n- Catalogue projects as \"No. 01 / No. 02\" for subtle collector framing;\n  toolbox as mono code-spans instead of badge soup.\n- Fix contact email; LinkedIn badge drops its logo (Simple Icons no\n  longer ships the glyph) and renders text-only.\n- Commit logo as