n- Signals para manejo de estado reactivo\n- Guards funcionales (no clases)\n- Interceptors funcionales con Angular 17+\n- Lazy loading para optimización\n\n🎯 Funcionalidades implementadas:\n- Login con usuarios demo (student/teacher/admin@campus.com)\n- Dashboard personalizado por rol de usuario\n- Navegación protegida con guards\n- Manejo automático de tokens de autenticación\n- Interfaz responsive y moderna\n\n🧪 Testing:\n- Aplicación compila correctamente\n- Servidor de desarrollo funcional\n- Lazy loading operativo\n\nEste commit representa el estado final esperado tras completar la Sesión 1 del curso.","tree":{"sha":"d29608342e16a019c2aa73a6b3a6ecaa5889b32f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/git/trees/d29608342e16a019c2aa73a6b3a6ecaa5889b32f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/git/commits/e3fe6d4bd41bbbcaced2a062632249267db87905","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/commit/e3fe6d4bd41bbbcaced2a062632249267db87905","node_id":"C_kwDOPuU6c9oAKGUzZmU2ZDRiZDQxYmJiY2FjZWQyYTA2MjYzMjI0OTI2N2RiODc5MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/commit/ab18f2cd30f7890bf6f956ce8c5aad5bda9befd5","sha":"ab18f2cd30f7890bf6f956ce8c5aad5bda9befd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/commits/ab18f2cd30f7890bf6f956ce8c5aad5bda9befd5"}],"sha":"e3fe6d4bd41bbbcaced2a062632249267db87905","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/commits/e3fe6d4bd41bbbcaced2a062632249267db87905"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Imagina-Formacion/curso-angular-20-avanzado/commits/58a98fcd83f95544316fc929d37231cdbeac8e05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-15T07:01:55Z","email":"paulo@macstu